.TH OPEN-TROFEO-LCD 1 "2026-05-19" "Open Trofeo LCD" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
open-trofeo-lcd \- launch the Open Trofeo LCD desktop editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B open-trofeo-lcd
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nh
.B Open Trofeo LCD
starts the Linux backend and graphical theme editor for Thermalright Trofeo LCD
cooler displays. The packaged launcher copies the read-only application tree to
a per-user working directory before starting the Python GUI.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/open-trofeo-lcd
Packaged application files.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/open-trofeo-lcd-workdir
Per-user writable working copy used by the launcher.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR playerctl (1),
.BR cava (1)
